{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32862","headline":"省试振鹭 · 李频","name":"省试振鹭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"有鸟生江浦，霜华作羽翰。\n君臣将比洁，朝野共相欢。\n月影林梢下，冰光水际残。\n翻飞时共乐，饮啄道皆安。\n逈翥宜高咏，羣栖入静看。\n由来鸳鹭侣，济济列千官。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李频","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32862.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32862","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}